er says "Lab 4 — Effect of Intersymbol Interference" but should be "Lab 4 — 16-QAM" (WRONG title)\n- Nov 17: Master has "Lab 5" but should be "Quiz 5" (WRONG event type)\n- Nov 30: Master has "Lab 5" ✓ (correct)\n\nThe summary is correct on all dates. The master has two mislabeled events.\n\n---\n\n## ENGG400 Flagged Cases\n\n**Sept 18:** Summary has "Lecture 3 — Ethics + Innovation in Industry; Quiz 2 Due 9:00 AM" on Sept 18. Master has NO ENGG400 entry for Sept 18.\n**Result: MISSING MASTER EVENT** — The source (ENGG400 syllabus course plan) confirms Lecture 3 is on Sept 18.\n\n**Sept 25:** Master has "Lecture 4 — Choose Your Own Adventure (Post-Grad Edition)" on Sept 25. Summary has "Lecture 4 — Choose Your Own Adventure" on Sept 25.\n**Result: SAME EVENT, DIFFERENT GROUPING** — The "Post-Grad Edition" subtitle is omitted in the summary but the event is present.\n\n**Sept 27:** Master has "Assignment 1 Due — IDP Background + Career Goals (11:59 PM)" on Sept 27. Summary has "Assignment 1 Due — IDP Background + Career Goals (11:59 PM)" on Sept 27.\n**Result: PASS** — Both agree. The automated report was wrong to flag this.\n\n**Oct 30:** Master has "Assignment 1 Due — IDP Background + Career Goals" on Oct 30. Summary has "Lecture 9 Reconciliation in Engineering" on Oct 30.\n**Result: REAL DATE ERROR** — The master has Assignment 1 on Oct 30, but the source says Assignment 1 is due Sunday, Sept 27th at 11:59 PM. The master has the wrong date for Assignment 1. The summary correctly has it on Sept 27.\n\n**Nov 27:** Master has "Assignment 2 Due — Individual Development Plan (IDP)" on Nov 27. Summary has "Lecture 12 Equity in Engineering; Assignment 2 Due — IDP (11:59 PM); Quiz 7 Due 9:00 AM" on Nov 27.\n**Result: SAME EVENT, DIFFERENT GROUPING** — The master has Assignment 2 on Nov 27 (correct per source: Nov 29th at 11:59 PM... wait, let me check).\n\nActually, the source says Assignment 2 is due Sunday, Nov 29th at 11:59 PM. The master has it on Nov 27. Let me re-ch