 my registered sections list but it's in my calendar. Help me figure this out.\n- The lecture sections: ECE302 LEC A2 seems to match D22, ECE449 LEC A1 matches D42, ECE485 LEC A1 matches D11, ECE490 LEC A1 matches D51. Confirm this pattern.\n\n### Step 2: Verify the filtered schedule\n- Cross-reference the filtered events against the calendar events\n- Check for any discrepancies (events in calendar not in schedule, or vice versa)\n- Identify any events that might be wrong or missing\n\n### Step 3: Create an updated calendar\n- After verification, compare ALL calendar events against the updated verified schedule\n- Find discrepancies between the calendar and the verified schedule\n- Create a new updated calendar file (NOT modifying FallCalender.ics — create a new file)\n- The new calendar should include only my relevant events, properly verified\n\n### Step 4: Create the final updated schedule_trial1.md\n- Update schedule_trial1.md with only the verified events for my sections\n\nPlease provide a clear step-by-step guide. After each step, I will verify the result with you before proceeding to the next step. Only give me ONE step at a time, and wait for my verification before giving me the next step.", 'timeout': 300000}
