 D22 and ECE 449 LAB D42 from source files.\n\nB) **Verify that all academic events in the schedule have calendar confirmation** where applicable (e.g., ECE302 D22 labs should align with the Tue 2:00-4:50 PM calendar slot).\n\nC) **Identify any events in the calendar that should generate schedule entries** (e.g., recurring lab meetings that should appear as recurring entries in the schedule).\n\nD) **Check for conflicts**: Are there any time conflicts between calendar events? (e.g., does ECE 449 LAB D42 on Thu 2:00-4:50 PM conflict with any other event?)\n\nPlease provide a detailed discrepancy report. Do NOT edit any files yet. Just identify the discrepancies and recommend how to handle them.", 'timeout': 300000}
